{% assign all_store_products = collections['all'].products %}
{% assign splash_count = 0 %}
{% for product_item in all_store_products %}
  {% if product_item.type == 'Body Splash' or product_item.tags contains 'Body Splash' %}{% assign splash_count = splash_count | plus: 1 %}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if splash_count > 0 %}
<section class="section body-splash-section" id="body-splash">
  <div class="page-width">
    <div class="section-head section-head--rich">
      <div><div class="eyebrow">PURE ESSENCE · BODY SPLASH 100 ML</div><h2>A mesma essência, em uma versão <span class="text-accent">mais leve.</span></h2><p class="section-intro">Body Splashes inspirados nas fragrâncias Pure Essence para reaplicar ao longo do dia, combinar com seu perfume e prolongar seu ritual.</p></div>
      <a class="section-link" href="/collections/body-splash"><span>Ver Body Splash</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M14 7l5 5-5 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a>
    </div>
    <div class="product-grid body-splash-grid">{% assign shown = 0 %}{% for product_item in all_store_products %}{% if product_item.type == 'Body Splash' or product_item.tags contains 'Body Splash' %}{% render 'product-card', product: product_item %}{% assign shown = shown | plus: 1 %}{% if shown >= 7 %}{% break %}{% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}
{% schema %}{"name":"Vitrine Body Splash","settings":[],"presets":[{"name":"Vitrine Body Splash"}]}{% endschema %}